---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { CONFIG } from '../lib/config';
---

<Layout
  title="Refund Policy & Accountability Deposit Return — StreakGrid"
  description="Transparent refund and settlement policy for Stake Challenges on StreakGrid."
>
  <div class="legal-page-layout">
    <header class="legal-header">
      <div class="legal-header-inner">
        <a href="/" class="brand-link">
          <div class="brand-badge">✓</div>
          <span class="brand-name">StreakGrid</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm">Return Home</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="legal-content-container">
      <div class="legal-doc-card">
        <div class="doc-header">
          <span class="doc-tag">Transparency & Compliance</span>
          <h1 class="doc-title">Refund & Settlement Policy</h1>
          <span class="doc-date">Effective Date: September 2026</span>
        </div>

        <div class="doc-body">
          <section class="doc-section">
            <h2>1. Nature of Accountability Deposits</h2>
            <p>
              When participating in a Stake Challenge, your deposit is held in a dedicated, simulated escrow reserve. It is not operating capital for StreakGrid and is not subjected to pooled wagering or contest distribution.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="doc-section">
            <h2>2. Full Refund Conditions (Success)</h2>
            <p>
              Your accountability deposit is returned in full when you fulfill the locked rules agreed upon at creation:
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>Reaching the required number of successful days according to your selected success rule.</li>
              <li>Maintaining tracking consistency across the challenge duration.</li>
              <li>Submitting project or completion proof if your challenge required verified public outputs.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>
              Once completed and verified, your refund is initiated immediately and returned to the original payment method without deduction of platform fees (100% principal return).
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="doc-section">
            <h2>3. Forfeiture Conditions (Failure)</h2>
            <p>
              If a challenge deadline arrives and the locked consistency criteria have not been satisfied:
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>The challenge concludes with status: <em>«Challenge ended before the required consistency target was reached.»</em></li>
              <li>The deposit is forfeited in accordance with the locked challenge agreement.</li>
              <li>StreakGrid never uses shame-based messaging or public humiliation. The outcome is treated calmly as an objective record of consistency.</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section class="doc-section">
            <h2>4. Voluntary Cancellation Before Activation</h2>
            <p>
              You may cancel a challenge and abandon payment checkout at any time prior to verified payment. Once a payment is confirmed by the payment gateway and the commitment lock is engaged, premature cancellation is unavailable to protect the commitment integrity.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="doc-section">
            <h2>5. Dispute Window & Review Guarantee</h2>
            <p>
              If an error or technical malfunction falsely marks a day as missed, you have <strong>{CONFIG.disputeWindowDays} calendar days</strong> from challenge completion to file a dispute via the challenge interface. Our administrative review evaluates server logs and external evidence to issue a full refund when warranted.
            </p>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page-layout {
    min-height: 100vh;
    background: var(--color-bg);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .legal-header {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding: 12px 20px;
  }

  .legal-header-inner {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .brand-link {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .brand-badge {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    background: var(--color-primary);
    border-radius: 5px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .legal-content-container {
    max-width: 860px;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 30px auto 80px auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  .legal-doc-card {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-modal);
    padding: 40px 36px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 28px;
  }

  .doc-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
    padding-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .doc-tag {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-primary-hover);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .doc-title {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--color-text);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .doc-date {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .doc-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .doc-section {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .doc-section h2 {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .doc-section ul {
    margin-left: 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }
</style>
